---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const user = Astro.locals.user;
---
<BaseLayout user={user} seo={{ title: 'Terms of Service — CrossLinkd', description: 'Terms for using CrossLinkd, a community directory of owner-submitted listings. Publishing is not a verification.', path: '/terms' }}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm" style="color:var(--text-mute)">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--text-soft)">
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">1. A directory, not an endorsement.</strong> CrossLinkd is a community directory of owner-submitted listings. A listing may appear in search results, including sorted or highlighted results. Inclusion, sort order, or a highlight is not a theological endorsement, denominational approval, or a verification of faith, ownership, licenses, credentials, or service quality.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">2. Accurate listings.</strong> You confirm that what you submit is accurate to the best of your knowledge, that you have the right to list or claim it, and that any credential or license you write is yours to state. Publishing asks you to confirm that before the listing can go up. CrossLinkd does not independently check faith, ownership, licenses, credentials, or service quality. A complete form may be published as an owner-submitted listing before anyone reviews it.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">3. Respectful conduct.</strong> Reviews and messages must follow our Community Guidelines and Review Policy. Harassment, hate, spam, and misinformation are prohibited. A report sent through the contact form is saved for a person to read. Saving a report is not an automatic takedown, and it does not verify the listings that remain.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">4. Regulated professions.</strong> If you list a counseling, healthcare, legal, financial, or contracting practice, do not misstate licensure. The listing form does not collect license documents, and CrossLinkd does not check license databases. We may later edit or remove a listing if we learn that a license claim is misstated. That is a directory decision, not a verification of the listings that remain.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">5. Youth safety.</strong> If a listing serves minors, you are responsible for complying with applicable law. The listing form does not collect a safeguarding statement, and CrossLinkd does not inspect safeguarding practices before publishing. If we ask through the contact process, you must be able to describe those practices.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">6. Content you submit.</strong> You grant CrossLinkd a license to store, format, and display content you submit so the directory can operate. You keep ownership of that content. Marking an account deleted, as described in the Privacy Policy, does not by itself unpublish listings. To ask that a listing be corrected or removed, use the contact form. A saved request is not an instant removal.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">7. Moderation.</strong> We may edit, suspend, or remove content that violates these terms. We do not promise notice before we do that. You can ask for another look on the appeals page. That request is saved for a person to read. Saving it does not promise a reply, a separate reviewer, or that the decision will change.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">8. Limitation of liability.</strong> The service is provided “as is.” We are not liable for transactions or other dealings between users and listings. Read a listing, then decide for yourself.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">9. No fees right now.</strong> The listing, claim, and account forms do not ask for payment details. CrossLinkd does not charge for listings, claiming, or accounts at this time. If we add a paid feature later, this section will be updated before any billing begins, and any sponsored placement will be labeled. Payment would not create a verification.</p>
      <p>Questions? <a href="/contact" class="underline">Contact us</a>. A saved message is not a promise of a reply time. See also: <a href="/privacy" class="underline">Privacy</a>, <a href="/guidelines" class="underline">Guidelines</a>, <a href="/appeals" class="underline">Appeals</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
